Move the 1.3.0 release tree to the vc/wasm branch tip (aa94fefa6bea8e40)

JuliaLang/julia's branch vc/wasm carries Keno Fischer's WebAssembly port:
an interpreter-only runtime (no code generator), the generated foreigncall
dispatch table src/interpreter-foreigncall.c, ui/wasm-support.c,
src/jsvm-emscripten/, and the build-system support for OS=emscripten. It was
never released or tagged, so there is no tarball for it.

This patch is the difference between the v1.3.0 release tarball and that
branch tip. Besides the port itself it therefore also carries the branch's
divergence from the release: vc/wasm was cut from master on 2019-07-11 and
last updated on 2019-12-02, a week after 1.3.0 was released, so some changes
that went into the release are reverted here and some later master changes
are pulled in. Applying it reproduces the branch's source tree exactly; the
patches that follow are this recipe's own work on top of it.

The release tarball's generated files (base/version_git.jl, doc/_build) are
left alone.
